  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS 9798 Advancing medium and long-term adaptation planning in the Republic of Serbia &#x2013; phase 2 (NAP2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds on the first phase of the project (implemented form 2020-2023, project ID 00106706) and will focus on the implementation of the Action Plan of the National Climate Change Adaptation Program, the development of a knowledge base for adaptation measures in the priority sector, and capacity building for financing medium- and long-term CCA .The overall goal of the NAP will be to reduce climate change related risks throughout Serbia by strengthening institutional and technical capac</narrative>
  </description>
